                        "sense_id": "af3e6aa9-95a9-385d-8c2c-6c05d018a79f",
                        "entry_id": "4d63c68c-4677-3013-9b7e-fc82a03275f8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A member of an ethnic group in Ireland, Scotland and the Isle of Man, whose language is one that is Gaelic."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1a7eabc3-391d-4ec9-b64c-de4031becd19",
                                "sense_id": "af3e6aa9-95a9-385d-8c2c-6c05d018a79f",
                                "text": "For the great Gaels of Ireland\nAre the men that God made mad,\nFor all their wars are merry,\nAnd all their songs are sad."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1eb1e172-d6ed-4c25-8f5e-1a5d3c8ae828",
                                "sense_id": "af3e6aa9-95a9-385d-8c2c-6c05d018a79f",
                                "text": "For England knows and England fears the famous Northern Gael and that's another reason why we'll free our lads in Crumlin Jail."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "59307e45-26da-47e2-8c93-2380ea2b7c12",
                                "sense_id": "af3e6aa9-95a9-385d-8c2c-6c05d018a79f",
                                "text": "Every cock in the farmyard stock crows a triumph to the Gael and it wouldn't be surprising if there'd be another rising said the man from the Daily Mail."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
